Subject to full compliance with this file, the Copyright Holder grants you a **worldwide, non-exclusive,
non-transferable, non-sublicensable, royalty-free** licence to do the following, **for Non-Commercial Use only**:

1. **学习与研究**：在个人设备上下载、安装、运行、阅读、调试、分析本作品，用于学习引擎、坐标系统、相机控制、
   方块系统、代码塔、运行时 C# 代码编辑器等实现原理。/
   **Study and research**: download, install, run, read, debug and analyse the Work on your own devices in order
   to learn how the engine, coordinate system, camera control, block system, code tower and runtime C# editor work.
2. **教学**：在课堂、社团、公开课、线上课程中演示、讲解本作品，包括在**不收取任何费用**的前提下向学员分发副本。/
   **Teaching**: demonstrate and explain the Work in classes, clubs, open lectures and online courses, including
   distributing copies to students **free of charge**.
3. **非盈利开源项目**：把本作品的代码或资源用于**不收任何费用、不含任何盈利入口**的个人或社区开源项目。/
   **Non-profit open source**: use the Work's code or assets in personal or community open-source projects that
   **charge no fee and contain no monetisation of any kind**.
4. **修改与改进**：修改本作品、创作衍生作品，仅用于上述非商业目的。/
   **Modification**: modify the Work and create Derivative Works, strictly for the non-commercial purposes above.
5. **非商业分发**：在**完全免费、无任何对价、无广告、无赞助、无付费入口**的前提下，向他人分发本作品或其
   未修改/已修改的副本（例如学习小组内部分享）。/
   **Non-commercial distribution**: distribute the Work, modified or not, only where it is **entirely free of
   charge, consideration, advertising, sponsorship and paid entry points** (for example sharing within a study group).

