## 6. 「商业用途」的定义与清单 / Definition and List of Commercial Use

**6.1** 「商业用途」指**任何直接或间接获取经济利益的使用**，不论是否实际盈利、不论主体是个人、个体户、
公司、社会团体还是其他组织、不论是否以营利为登记目的。是否收费、是否盈利不影响定性。

"Commercial Use" means **any use that obtains direct or indirect economic benefit**, whether or not a profit is
actually made, whether the user is an individual, a sole trader, a company, an association or any other entity,
and whether or not the entity is registered as for-profit. Neither charging a fee nor making a profit is required
for a use to be commercial.

**6.2 商业用途包括但不限于 / Commercial Use includes, without limitation:**

| # | 场景 / Scenario | 说明 / Notes |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **上架发行** / Publishing | 在 Steam、Epic、itch.io、App Store、Google Play、主机平台、微信小游戏、抖音小游戏、快应用、H5 平台等任何渠道发布含本作品全部或部分内容的游戏或应用。/ Releasing a game or app containing the Work, in whole or in part, on Steam, Epic, itch.io, the App Store, Google Play, consoles, WeChat mini-games, Douyin mini-games, quick apps, H5 platforms or any other channel. |
| 2 | **付费获取** / Paid access | 付费下载、买断销售、抢先体验收费、付费解锁、会员专享、付费墙后的内容。/ Paid downloads, one-off sales, paid early access, paid unlocks, members-only content, content behind a paywall. |
| 3 | **内购与订阅** / IAP and subscriptions | 应用内购买、虚拟货币、道具、皮肤、季卡、订阅制服务。/ In-app purchases, virtual currency, items, skins, season passes, subscription services. |
| 4 | **广告与流量变现** / Advertising | 广告位、插屏、激励视频、开屏、买量投放后的变现、平台流量分成与创作激励计划。/ Ad slots, interstitials, rewarded videos, splash ads, monetisation of user-acquisition traffic, platform revenue sharing and creator incentive programmes. |
| 5 | **公司内部生产使用** / Internal production use | 在公司、工作室或其他组织内部，把本作品或其代码、资源用于任何生产性工作（含内部工具、原型、演示、投标方案、员工培训教材）。/ Using the Work, its code or assets for any production work inside a company, studio or other organisation (including internal tools, prototypes, demos, bid proposals and staff training material). |
| 6 | **外包与受托交付** / Contract and freelance delivery | 在受托项目中使用本作品并向客户交付，无论你本人是否另行收费。/ Using the Work in client work and delivering it, whether or not you charge separately for it. |
| 7 | **二次销售与转售** / Resale | 销售、转售、租赁、捆绑销售本作品或其衍生作品；把本作品作为商品、赠品或促销物的一部分。/ Selling, reselling, renting or bundling the Work or a Derivative Work; making it part of a product, gift or promotion. |
| 8 | **SaaS 与在线服务** / SaaS and online services | 把本作品部署为网络服务、在线编辑器、云工具、API 后端，向用户收费或以其他方式变现。/ Deploying the Work as a web service, online editor, cloud tool or API backend, charged for or otherwise monetised. |
| 9 | **收费教学** / Paid teaching | 收费课程、训练营、付费社群、付费教程、付费直播、以本作品为卖点的付费内容。/ Paid courses, bootcamps, paid communities, paid tutorials, paid livestreams, and paid content that uses the Work as a selling point. |
| 10 | **商业孵化与投资** / Commercial incubation | 用于创业项目、商业计划、融资演示、孵化器与加速器项目。/ Use in start-ups, business plans, investor pitches, incubators and accelerators. |
| 11 | **硬件与设备预装** / Pre-installation | 预装或随硬件、设备、开发板、教育套件出厂交付。/ Pre-installing or shipping with hardware, devices, development boards or education kits. |
| 12 | **素材与数据集** / Asset and dataset supply | 把本作品的代码或资源放入对外提供的素材库、模板库、代码库、数据集、课程包、AI 训练数据。/ Placing the Work's code or assets into an asset library, template store, code repository, dataset, course pack or AI training corpus offered to others. |
| 13 | **品牌与宣传** / Branding and promotion | 在宣传物料、展会、广告、招聘、投标中以本作品作为能力证明并直接或间接获取商业利益。/ Using the Work as evidence of capability in marketing material, trade shows, advertising, recruiting or bidding, where commercial benefit is obtained directly or indirectly. |
| 14 | **关联与变相使用** / Related and indirect use | 通过关联公司、第三方、代理、开源外壳、改名改包等方式规避本条款的间接或变相商业使用。/ Indirect or disguised commercial use through affiliates, third parties, agents, open-source wrappers, renaming or repackaging, in order to circumvent this section. |

