## 9. 终止 / Termination

**9.1 自动终止**：你违反本文件任何条款（尤其是第 4、5、6 条）时，本文件授予你的全部许可**自动终止**，
无需版权人另行通知。终止后你必须立即停止使用、复制、分发本作品及其衍生作品。
**Automatic termination**: if you breach any term of this file (in particular Sections 4, 5 and 6), all licences
granted to you **terminate automatically**, without further notice. You must then immediately stop using, copying
and distributing the Work and any Derivative Work.

**9.2 后果**：终止后继续使用、分发本作品，属于对著作权的侵犯；已分发的副本，你应在其能力范围内停止继续提供。
**Consequences**: continued use or distribution after termination infringes copyright; for copies already
distributed, you must stop making them available to the extent you are able to do so.

**9.3 恢复**：版权人可自行决定以书面形式恢复许可，恢复条件（包括补正与追溯授权费用）由版权人确定。
**Reinstatement**: the Copyright Holder may, at its sole discretion, reinstate the licence in writing, on terms it
determines (including cure and retroactive licence fees).

**9.4 存续条款**：第 1、5、6、10、11、12、13 条在本许可终止后继续有效。
**Survival**: Sections 1, 5, 6, 10, 11, 12 and 13 survive termination.

